    Feedback[Feedback & Notifications<br/>src/components/feedback/<br/>7 components]
    Modals[Modals & Dialogs<br/>src/components/modals/<br/>3 components]
    Layout[Layout & Structure<br/>src/components/layout/<br/>10 components]
    Game[Game Logic<br/>src/components/game/<br/>8 components]

